  "body": "This immutable patch release closes the two bounded findings from the independent v1.0.10 referee audit.\n\n- Certificate generation and both exact readers now select the 22-term U and 84-term A coefficient fields explicitly and reject conflicting recognized fields.\n- The five SIADS overfull boxes are repaired, and canonical, detached journal, detached source-package, and cover-letter builds now share a fail-closed final TeX-log gate with mutation controls.\n- All manuscripts, submission source bundles, public data, and specialist audit packets were rebuilt with the pinned toolchain.\n\nNo reaction topology, theorem, repaired endpoint, exact diffusion profile, nonlinear coefficient, or numerical datum changed. The portable replay, 39 regression tests, all direct verifier and optimized-Python controls, exact symbolic checks, detached source builds, PDF audits, and release manifests pass."
}
